      "content": "wait, you're sure mixing them is dangerous? the person on the forum said it's fine as long as you don't go over a certain amount. i'm just really trying to avoid the er since my insurance is so high, and honestly my throat feeling tight is probably just from all the coughing/sneezing all morning. it's not like it's an emergency or anything. \n\nif i just stick to the 100mg of diphenhydramine like you said, is it safe to just take a nap and wait for it to kick in? i'd rather just sleep the swelling off than go driving to a hospital right now.",
